email.activate-body:
Hi {name},

Click the link below to make this the email address for your {site} account:

{link}

Until you click it, your current address stays in use.

Thanks,
{site}

email.approve-body:
Hi {name},

We received a request to change the email address on your {site} account to {email}. If this was you, click the link below to continue:

{link}

If it wasn't you, don't click the link, and change your password right away.

Thanks,
{site}

email.hold-body:
Hi {name},

At your request, an administrator of {site} is changing the email address on your account to this one. Click the link below to confirm:

{link}

Once confirmed, the change takes effect in {days} days, and your old address can cancel it until then. If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email.

Thanks,
{site}

email.invite-body:
Hi,

You've been invited to join {site}. Click the link below to accept and set your password:

{link}

If you don't want to join, you can ignore this email.

Thanks,
{site}

email.password-body:
Hi {name},

The password for your {site} account was just changed.

If this wasn't you, reset your password right away using the link below:

{link}

Thanks,
{site}

email.verify-body:
Hi {name},

Click the link below to verify this email address. You'll need a verified address to reset your password:

{link}

If you didn't request this, you can ignore this email.

Thanks,
{site}
